    <!-- Guide / Help Content -->
    <string name="guide_content">
Umhlahlandlela wesinyathelo ngesinyathelo\n
1. Khetha isithombe sobungcweti sephrofayela\n
-Sebenzisa isithombe esicacile noma ilogo yobungcweti.\n
-Qinisekisa ukuthi isithombe sikhanya kahle futhi ubuso bubonakala.\n
-Gwema izithombe eziguquguqukayo noma ezingacacile.\n
\n
2. Bhala isihloko esinamandla\n
-Sifushane, sichaze, futhi sifake amakhono akho.\n
Isibonelo: “Umakhi wezithombe | Izixazululo zeLogo nokuBranding”\n
Amathiphu:\n
-Gxila ebungcweti nasekuhlanzeni.\n
-Sebenzisa amagama akhangayo abantu abawafunayo.\n
-Yiba qotho ngamakhono akho nesikhathi sokuletha umsebenzi.
    </string>
